   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Menu Price Board\n\nA clean menu board: the title rises through a mask, then each item slides in with its dotted leader and its price, a short note appears and the shop details rise at the bottom. White page, black type, one accent on the note and the order button. Items come from one variable, one per line as \"Name|Price\".\n\nCategory: commerce. Length: 8 s. WebGL: no.\n\nUse when:\n- A food or drink menu, a service price list or a class schedule with prices.\n- Three to eight short lines that should be read one by one.\n\nAvoid when:\n- A single product with an old and a new price: use price-drop.\n- More than eight items: split them over several boards.\n- Long descriptions per item: the rows are made for a name, a price and a few words.\n\nVariables:\n- kicker (string): Kicker, default \"Dari dapur kami,\"\n- title (string): Title, default \"Menu Hari Ini\"\n- items (string): Items, default \"Nasi Ayam Bakar|Rp25.000|sambal matah, lalapan\\nSoto Betawi|Rp28.000|kuah santan gurih\\nMie Goreng Jawa|Rp22.000|pakai telur bebek\\nEs Teh Serai|Rp8.000|segar, tidak terlalu manis\"\n- note (string): Note, default \"favorit!\"\n- footer_name (string): Footer name, default \"Dapur Mama Ika\"\n- footer_line (string): Footer line, default \"Buka setiap hari 10.00\\u201321.00\"\n- footer_button (string): Footer button, default \"Pesan: 0812-3456-7890\"\n- bg_color (color): Background, default \"#ffffff\"\n- accent_color (color): Accent, default \"#2563eb\"\n- text_color (color): Text colour, default \"#0a0a0a\"\n- muted_color (color): Muted colour, default \"#737373\"\n- transparent (boolean): Transparent, default false\n\nSource: Mosio original. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
  },
  {
   "path": "scene.html",
   "role": "source",
   "content": "<!doctype html>\n<!--\n  Menu Price Board\n\n  A menu or price list that fills in row by row: name, dotted leader, price, with a short note.\n\n  Extracted from the Mosio recipe menu-board by usemosio/blocks.\n-->\n<html\n  lang=\"en\"\n  data-composition-id=\"menu-price-board\"\n  data-composition-duration=\"8\"\n  data-composition-variables='[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"kicker\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Kicker\",\n    \"description\": \"Small muted line above the title.\",\n    \"default\": \"Dari dapur kami,\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"title\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Title\",\n    \"description\": \"Board title, one line.\",\n    \"default\": \"Menu Hari Ini\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"items\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Items\",\n    \"description\": \"One item per line, \\\"Name|Price\\\" or \\\"Name|Price|Short note\\\". Up to 8 lines.\",\n    \"default\": \"Nasi Ayam Bakar|Rp25.000|sambal matah, lalapan\\nSoto Betawi|Rp28.000|kuah santan gurih\\nMie Goreng Jawa|Rp22.000|pakai telur bebek\\nEs Teh Serai|Rp8.000|segar, tidak terlalu manis\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"note\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Note\",\n    \"description\": \"Short italic note in the accent colour, top right. Leave empty to hide it.\",\n    \"default\": \"favorit!\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"footer_name\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Footer name\",\n    \"description\": \"Shop name at the bottom. Leave empty to hide the footer.\",\n    \"default\": \"Dapur Mama Ika\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"footer_line\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Footer line\",\n    \"description\": \"Opening hours or address under the shop name.\",\n    \"default\": \"Buka setiap hari 10.00–21.00\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"footer_button\",\n    \"type\": \"string\",\n    \"role\": \"content\",\n    \"label\": \"Footer button\",\n    \"description\": \"Pill with how to order.\",\n    \"default\": \"Pesan: 0812-3456-7890\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"bg_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Background\",\n    \"description\": \"Board background.\",\n    \"default\": \"#ffffff\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"accent_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Accent\",\n    \"description\": \"Note and footer button: the one accent.\",\n    \"default\": \"#2563eb\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"text_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Text colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Title, item names and prices.\",\n    \"default\": \"#0a0a0a\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"muted_color\",\n    \"type\": \"color\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Muted colour\",\n    \"description\": \"Kicker, short notes under item names and the footer line.\",\n    \"default\": \"#737373\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"transparent\",\n    \"type\": \"boolean\",\n    \"role\": \"style\",\n    \"label\": \"Transparent\",\n    \"description\": \"Leave the background clear.\",\n    \"default\": false\n  }\n]'\n>\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <title>Menu Price Board</title>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <template>\n      <link\n        rel=\"stylesheet\"\n        href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600;700&amp;display=block\"\n      />\n      <style>\n        #root {\n          position: absolute; inset: 0; overflow: hidden; container-type: size; pointer-events: none;\n          -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n        #root * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n        .mb-stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; --u: calc(100cqmin / 1080); }\n\n        #root { background: var(--mb-bg); color: var(--mb-text); font-family: Geist, system-ui, sans-serif; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n        .mb-col { position: absolute; left: calc(var(--u) * 110); right: calc(var(--u) * 110); top: calc(var(--u) * 130); bottom: calc(var(--u) * 130); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n        .mb-kicker { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 44); font-weight: 500; color: var(--mb-muted); line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }\n        .mb-titlew { position: relative; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; overflow: hidden; padding-bottom: calc(var(--u) * 8); margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 8); }\n        .mb-title { display: inline-block; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 120); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.05em; }\n        .mb-list { position: relative; flex: 1; min-height: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-evenly; margin: calc(var(--u) * 20) 0; }\n        .mb-item { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: calc(var(--u) * 20); }\n        .mb-left { min-width: 0; }\n        .mb-name { font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 1.15; }\n        .mb-note-s { display: block; color: var(--mb-muted); margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 2); white-space: nowrap; }\n        .mb-dots { flex: 1; min-width: calc(var(--u) * 40); position: relative; top: -0.25em; border-bottom: calc(var(--u) * 3) dotted color-mix(in oklab, var(--mb-text) 28%, transparent); transform-origin: 0 50%; }\n        .mb-price { font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--mb-text); white-space: nowrap; }\n        .mb-hand { position: absolute; right: calc(var(--u) * 110); top: calc(var(--u) * 136); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 40); color: var(--mb-accent); white-space: nowrap; z-index: 2; }\n        .mb-foot { text-align: center; }\n        .mb-fname { font-weight: 600; font-size: calc(var(--u) * 60); letter-spacing: -0.04em; line-height: 1.2; }\n        .mb-fline { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 8); font-size: calc(var(--u) * 36); color: var(--mb-muted); }\n        .mb-fbtn { display: inline-block; margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 18); padding: calc(var(--u) * 18) calc(var(--u) * 46); border-radius: calc(var(--u) * 60); background: var(--mb-accent); color: var(--mb-ink); font-size: calc(var(--u) * 38); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }\n        @container (aspect-ratio > 1) {\n          .mb-col { left: calc(var(--u) * 200); right: calc(var(--u) * 200); top: calc(var(--u) * 100); bottom: calc(var(--u) * 90); }\n          .mb-kicker { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 36); }\n          .mb-title { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 92); }\n          .mb-hand { right: calc(var(--u) * 200); top: calc(var(--u) * 106); font-size: calc(var(--u) * 34); }\n          .mb-fname { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 44); } .mb-fline { font-size: calc(var(--u) * 30); margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 2); }\n          .mb-fbtn { margin-top: calc(var(--u) * 10); padding: calc(var(--u) * 12) calc(var(--u) * 36); font-size: calc(var(--u) * 32); }\n          .mb-list { margin: calc(var(--u) * 10) 0; }\n        }\n\n      </style>\n\n      <div id=\"root\" data-composition-id=\"menu-price-board\" data-duration=\"8\" data-fps=\"30\">\n        <div id=\"mb-clip\" class=\"mb-stage clip\" data-start=\"0\" data-duration=\"8\" data-track-index=\"0\">\n          <div class=\"mb-col\">\n            <div class=\"mb-kicker\" id=\"mb-kicker\"></div>\n            <div class=\"mb-titlew\" id=\"mb-titlew\"><span class=\"mb-title\" id=\"mb-title\"></span></div>\n            <div class=\"mb-list\" id=\"mb-list\"></div>\n            <div class=\"mb-foot\" id=\"mb-foot\"><div class=\"mb-fname\" id=\"mb-fname\"></div><div class=\"mb-fline\" id=\"mb-fline\"></div><span class=\"mb-fbtn\" id=\"mb-fbtn\"></span></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mb-hand\" id=\"mb-hand\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.14.2/dist/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n        <script>\n          (function () {\n            \"use strict\";\n            var root = document.getElementById(\"root\");\n            var vars = window.__hyperframes && window.__hyperframes.getVariables ? window.__hyperframes.getVariables() || {} : {};\n            function num(v, d, a, b) { var n = Number(v); return Number.isFinite(n) ? Math.min(b, Math.max(a, n)) : d; }\n            function str(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() ? v : d; }\n            function colr(v, d) { return typeof v === \"string\" && v.trim() && window.CSS && CSS.supports(\"color\", v.trim()) ? v.trim() : d; }\n            function bool(v, d) { return v === true || v === \"true\" ? true : v === false || v === \"false\" ? false : d; }\n            function el(tag, cls, parent, html) { var e = document.createElement(tag); if (cls) e.className = cls; if (html !== undefined) e.innerHTML = html; if (parent) parent.appendChild(e); return e; }\n            function esc(s) { return String(s).replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\").replace(/</g, \"&lt;\"); }\n            function dots(n) { return String(Math.round(n)).replace(/\\B(?=(\\d{3})+(?!\\d))/g, \".\"); }\n            function ink(c, thr) {\n              var m = /^#([0-9a-f]{3}|[0-9a-f]{6})$/i.exec(String(c).trim());\n              if (!m) return \"#14161a\";\n              var h = m[1].length === 3 ? m[1].replace(/./g, \"$&$&\") : m[1];\n              var r = parseInt(h.slice(0, 2), 16), g = parseInt(h.slice(2, 4), 16), b = parseInt(h.slice(4, 6), 16);\n              return 0.299 * r + 0.587 * g + 0.114 * b > (thr || 150) ? \"#14161a\" : \"#ffffff\";\n            }\n            function setColors(p, list) {\n              list.forEach(function (c) { root.style.setProperty(\"--\" + p + \"-\" + c[0], colr(vars[c[1]], c[2])); });\n            }\n            // Shrink a one-line element's wrapper (flex, centred) when its content is wider than the wrapper.\n            var fitList = [];\n            function fit(wrap) { fitList.push(wrap); refit(); }\n            function refit() {\n              fitList.forEach(function (w) {\n                w.style.transform = \"\";\n                var c = w.firstElementChild, cw = c ? c.offsetWidth : 0, aw = w.clientWidth;\n                if (cw > aw && aw > 0) w.style.transform = \"scale(\" + (aw / cw).toFixed(4) + \")\";\n              });\n            }\n            if (document.fonts && document.fonts.ready) document.fonts.ready.then(refit);\n            var W = root.clientWidth || 1080, H = root.clientHeight || 1920, U = Math.min(W, H) / 1080;\n            if (bool(vars.transparent, false)) root.style.background = \"transparent\";\n\n\n            setColors(\"mb\", [[\"bg\", \"bg_color\", \"#ffffff\"], [\"accent\", \"accent_color\", \"#2563eb\"],\n              [\"text\", \"text_color\", \"#0a0a0a\"], [\"muted\", \"muted_color\", \"#737373\"]]);\n            root.style.setProperty(\"--mb-ink\", ink(colr(vars.accent_color, \"#2563eb\")));\n            var kicker = typeof vars.kicker === \"string\" ? vars.kicker : \"Dari dapur kami,\";\n            var title = str(vars.title, \"Menu Hari Ini\");\n            var def = \"Nasi Ayam Bakar|Rp25.000|sambal matah, lalapan\\nSoto Betawi|Rp28.000|kuah santan gurih\\nMie Goreng Jawa|Rp22.000|pakai telur bebek\\nEs Teh Serai|Rp8.000|segar, tidak terlalu manis\";\n            var rows = String(typeof vars.items === \"string\" && vars.items.trim() ? vars.items : def).split(/\\r?\\n/).map(function (l) {\n              var p = l.split(\"|\"); return { name: p[0].trim(), price: (p[1] || \"\").trim(), note: (p[2] || \"\").trim() };\n            }).filter(function (r) { return r.name; }).slice(0, 8);\n            var note = typeof vars.note === \"string\" ? vars.note.trim() : \"favorit!\";\n            var fname = typeof vars.footer_name === \"string\" ? vars.footer_name.trim() : \"Dapur Mama Ika\";\n            var fline = typeof vars.footer_line === \"string\" ? vars.footer_line.trim() : \"\";\n            var fbtn = typeof vars.footer_button === \"string\" ? vars.footer_button.trim() : \"\";\n            var N = rows.length;\n\n            document.getElementById(\"mb-kicker\").textContent = kicker;\n            if (!kicker) document.getElementById(\"mb-kicker\").style.display = \"none\";\n            document.getElementById(\"mb-title\").textContent = title;\n            var list = document.getElementById(\"mb-list\");\n            rows.forEach(function (r, i) {\n              var it = el(\"div\", \"mb-item\", list);\n              it.id = \"mb-item-\" + i;\n              var left = el(\"div\", \"mb-left\", it);\n              el(\"div\", \"mb-name\", left).textContent = r.name;\n              if (r.note) el(\"span\", \"mb-note-s\", left).textContent = r.note;\n              el(\"div\", \"mb-dots\", it);\n              el(\"div\", \"mb-price\", it).textContent = r.price;\n            });\n            var foot = document.getElementById(\"mb-foot\");\n            document.getElementById(\"mb-fname\").textContent = fname;\n            document.getElementById(\"mb-fline\").textContent = fline;\n            document.getElementById(\"mb-fbtn\").textContent = fbtn;\n            if (!fline) document.getElementById(\"mb-fline\").style.display = \"none\";\n            if (!fbtn) document.getElementById(\"mb-fbtn\").style.display = \"none\";\n            if (!fname && !fline && !fbtn) foot.style.display = \"none\";\n            var hand = document.getElementById(\"mb-hand\");\n            hand.textContent = note; if (!note) hand.style.display = \"none\";\n\n            // Item size follows the room each row gets, so 3 or 8 items both fill the board.\n            function sizeRows() {\n              var h = list.clientHeight, rowH = h / Math.max(1, N);\n              var fs = Math.max(26, Math.min(66 * U, rowH * (rows.some(function (r) { return r.note; }) && rowH > 110 * U ? 0.38 : 0.5)));\n              var hasNote = rows.some(function (r) { return r.note; }) && rowH > 110 * U;\n              list.querySelectorAll(\".mb-name\").forEach(function (e) { e.style.fontSize = fs + \"px\"; });\n              list.querySelectorAll(\".mb-price\").forEach(function (e) { e.style.fontSize = fs * 1.07 + \"px\"; });\n              list.querySelectorAll(\".mb-note-s\").forEach(function (e) { e.style.fontSize = fs * 0.58 + \"px\"; e.style.display = hasNote ? \"block\" : \"none\"; });\n            }\n            sizeRows();\n            if (document.fonts && document.fonts.ready) document.fonts.ready.then(sizeRows);\n            fit(document.getElementById(\"mb-titlew\"));\n\n            var step = Math.min(0.55, 3.2 / Math.max(1, N));\n            var tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true });\n            tl.fromTo(\"#mb-kicker\", { y: -20 * U, opacity: 0 }, { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.3);\n            tl.fromTo(\"#mb-title\", { yPercent: 115 }, { yPercent: 0, duration: 0.8, ease: \"expo.out\" }, 0.5);\n            var t0 = 1.6;\n            rows.forEach(function (r, i) {\n              var at = t0 + i * step, it = \"#mb-item-\" + i;\n              tl.fromTo(it, { x: -80 * U, opacity: 0 }, { x: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power3.out\" }, at);\n              tl.fromTo(it + \" .mb-dots\", { scaleX: 0 }, { scaleX: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power2.out\" }, at + 0.2);\n              tl.fromTo(it + \" .mb-price\", { scale: 0.4, opacity: 0 }, { scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 0.45, ease: \"power3.out\", transformOrigin: \"100% 60%\" }, at + 0.45);\n            });\n            var done = t0 + (N - 1) * step + 0.9;\n            tl.fromTo(\"#mb-hand\", { y: 16 * U, opacity: 0 }, { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power3.out\" }, done);\n            tl.fromTo(\"#mb-foot > *\", { y: 60 * U, opacity: 0 }, { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 0.6, ease: \"power3.out\", stagger: 0.18 }, done + 0.3);\n            // A light sweep along the prices keeps the board alive while it is held.\n            var sw = done + 1.6, sstep = Math.min(0.3, 1.5 / Math.max(1, N));\n            rows.forEach(function (r, i) {\n              tl.to(\"#mb-item-\" + i + \" .mb-price\", { scale: 1.08, duration: 0.25, yoyo: true, repeat: 1, ease: \"power2.inOut\", transformOrigin: \"100% 60%\" }, sw + i * sstep);\n            });\n\n            var total = parseFloat(root.dataset.duration || \"8\");\n            if (tl.duration() < total) tl.to({}, { duration: total - tl.duration() });\n            tl.seek(0);\n            window.__timelines = window.__timelines || {};\n            window.__timelines[\"menu-price-board\"] = tl;\n          })();\n        </script>\n      </div>\n    </template>\n  </body>\n</html>\n"
  }
 ],
